  biography: One of the "4 Immortals" of Vietnamese folklore. The young boy Giong
    from Giong village stretched himself into a mighty warrior, uprooting bamboo
    from his village to use as weapons to defeat the Yin invaders. Giong is a symbol
    of youthful strength and indomitable patriotism in the fight against foreign
    invaders.
  specialSkillName: Iron Horse's Breath
  specialSkillDescription: A series of attacks using bamboo sticks (Melee damage).
    Simultaneously, the Passive Skill activates the Iron Horse to continuously breathe
    fire, inflicting a "Burning" effect (Damage over time - DoT) on all surrounding
    enemies.
